:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Fuu (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Fuu''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Fuu
|image = E 094.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 800¢ - 3,160¢
}}

==Enemy==
She has a bulky amount of HP, as well as much higher DPS than previous Merc Storia enemies, which along with her ability to freeze, are capable of rendering melee units nearly useless. However, her range is pretty low and her backswing length makes her not so hard to stall. She's also very slow and has only one knockback.

